<div class="note">
  <p class="note__label">Reporting guidance</p>
  <p>Please confirm the following through an official summit announcement before reporting them as fact:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Venue and address</li>
    <li>Ticket prices and package benefits</li>
    <li>Speaker names and session titles</li>
    <li>Delegate, country or exhibitor numbers</li>
    <li>Institutional or government endorsements</li>
    <li>Partnership allocations</li>
  </ul>
</div>

